From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Proton GE Team <proton-ge@example.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 18:20:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] winedmo: Do not seek live HLS sources on startup.

Unknown-duration sources such as Twitch live HLS playlists are not seekable.
Advertising them as seekable and converting the initial VT_EMPTY start into a
seek to zero makes FFmpeg reject the operation and AVPro subsequently reports
an unknown playback error.

Only advertise seeking and rewind stopped sources when the demuxer supplied a
finite duration.  Keep pause support for both finite and live sources.
---
 dlls/winedmo/media_source.c | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c b/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c
index 8d2a4ae2f8b..db7b8d4ad12 100644
--- a/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c
@@ -854,7 +854,7 @@ static HRESULT media_source_start(struct media_source *source, IMFPresentationDe
         return MF_E_SHUTDOWN;
 
     /* seek to beginning on stop->play */
-    if (source->state == SOURCE_STOPPED && position->vt == VT_EMPTY)
+    if (source->has_duration && source->state == SOURCE_STOPPED && position->vt == VT_EMPTY)
     {
         position->vt = VT_I8;
         position->hVal.QuadPart = 0;
@@ -1960,7 +1960,10 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI media_source_GetCharacteristics(IMFMediaSource *iface, DWO
     if (source->state == SOURCE_SHUTDOWN)
         hr = MF_E_SHUTDOWN;
     else
-        *characteristics = MFMEDIASOURCE_CAN_SEEK | MFMEDIASOURCE_CAN_PAUSE;
+    {
+        *characteristics = MFMEDIASOURCE_CAN_PAUSE;
+        if (source->has_duration) *characteristics |= MFMEDIASOURCE_CAN_SEEK;
+    }
 
     LeaveCriticalSection(&source->cs);
 
